|    ```python
|      def wrap(lines, width):
|          rows = []
|          for line in lines:
|              if not line:
|                  rows.append('')
|                  continue
|              rows.extend(line[i:i + width] for i in
|    range(0, len(line), width))
|          return rows
|    ```
